WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.064
"Here, try this on," Markos' sister murmured.

2
00:00:07.065 --> 00:00:10.998
Julia took the chiton that the older girl held out.

3
00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:16.154
As soon as the kids had entered the house, Helene had taken Julia away.

4
00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:22.253
First she'd brought Julia into the kitchen and given her some figs to eat.

5
00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:27.013
Then she'd taken Julia to change clothes.

6
00:00:27.014 --> 00:00:32.703
"Why can't I wear my own clothes?" Julia glanced down at her jeans and T-shirt.

7
00:00:32.704 --> 00:00:39.561
"Father says we're supposed to help you and Brody blend in so Zeus doesn't notice you," Helene said.

8
00:00:39.562 --> 00:00:44.832
"If you insist on wearing such strange garments, you won't be allowed out of the house."

9
00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:53.572
Julia didn't like the sound of that. She put on the chiton and a pair of leather sandals.

10
00:00:53.573 --> 00:00:58.664
When the girls returned to the courtyard, Brody and Markos were already there.

11
00:00:58.665 --> 00:01:03.647
Brody was dressed in a short chiton, like the one Markos wore.

12
00:01:03.648 --> 00:01:07.733
"This is stupid," Brody was saying loudly.

13
00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:11.308
"If any of the guys on the football team saw me wearing a dress—" "How

14
00:01:11.309 --> 00:01:15.379
are they going to see you?" Julia snapped at him. "In

15
00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:19.184
case you forgot, Brody, we're in ancient Greece!" Before

16
00:01:19.185 --> 00:01:24.168
Brody could respond, Hermes appeared in a blast of light. "Good,

17
00:01:24.169 --> 00:01:28.228
they've found you some proper clothing," he said. "Let's

18
00:01:28.229 --> 00:01:31.698
go. It's time to start your training." "I'll

19
00:01:31.699 --> 00:01:36.568
come along, if you don't mind." Markos bowed to Hermes. "My

20
00:01:36.569 --> 00:01:41.074
father ordered me not to let your champion out of my sight." "Good,

21
00:01:41.075 --> 00:01:45.359
good. Come along then, boy," Hermes said. Julia

22
00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:49.013
stepped forward. "I'm coming too." Markos

23
00:01:49.014 --> 00:01:57.451
hesitated, but Hermes shrugged. "If having your companion along makes you run faster, Brody, she may come." "I

24
00:01:57.452 --> 00:02:00.860
don't care if she comes or not," Brody said. But

25
00:02:00.861 --> 00:02:08.472
Hermes was already striding toward the exit, the wings on his sandals fluttering with excitement. "I'm

26
00:02:08.473 --> 00:02:12.741
coming," Julia whispered to Brody with a frown. "We

27
00:02:12.742 --> 00:02:15.401
still need to figure out how to escape. And

28
00:02:15.402 --> 00:02:19.602
we can't do that if I'm stuck in the house." "Escape?

29
00:02:19.603 --> 00:02:28.269
Why would I want to escape?" Brody flexed his muscles. "I'm going to be an Olympic champion!" He

30
00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:36.984
hurried after Hermes. With a sigh Julia followed. Olympia's

31
00:02:36.985 --> 00:02:42.730
gymnasium was a long, low building with a huge, grassy courtyard. At

32
00:02:42.731 --> 00:02:51.358
least a dozen men and boys were exercising in the courtyard, tossing spears, stretching, or racing down a marked track. Several

33
00:02:51.359 --> 00:02:54.593
other gods were there too. "Who's

34
