?" Julia remembered that these were the names of different footraces, but Brody looked totally

45
00:03:55.587 --> 00:04:00.118
confused. "Brody isn't really a runner," she told

46
00:04:00.119 --> 00:04:04.386
Hermes. "I mean, he's not on the track team or anything like

47
00:04:04.387 --> 00:04:11.984
that." "Track?" Brody made a face. "No way! Those guys are nerds. I play

48
00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:17.327
football." "Foot?" Markos said, looking down.

49
00:04:17.328 --> 00:04:21.769
"Ball?" "What?" Hermes frowned at Brody in

50
00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.851
confusion. "But I saw you running like the

51
00:04:23.852 --> 00:04:26.259
wind. I watched you outpace the other

52
00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.713
mortals. Are you telling me that you are not a

53
