said. "I'm fast, like you said. That's why I make so many

55
00:04:38.155 --> 00:04:43.298
touchdowns." "Touchdowns?" Markos echoed. "What are

56
00:04:43.299 --> 00:04:46.934
they?" "Duh, it's how you score." Brody

57
00:04:46.935 --> 00:04:49.648
shrugged. "Haven't you guys ever seen a football

58
00:04:49.649 --> 00:04:55.661
game?" Julia poked him in the arm. "Duh, of course, they haven't," she

59
00:04:55.662 --> 00:05:00.192
said. "Football wasn't invented back then. I mean

60
00:05:00.193 --> 00:05:05.510
now." Hermes still looked a bit upset about Brody's lack of running

61
